ired for efficient formation of respiratory supercomplexes comprised of complexes III and IV."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}